                           "“You planned this?”",
                           "The accusation stung because it was sensible.",
                           "Gobolin reached slowly into his cloak and removed Vaerith\u0027s ring. He set it on the packed-earth floor. In the firelight, the laughing copper mouth seemed almost alive.",
                           "“This is the seal of Vaerith of the Verdigris Crown,” he said. “If I wanted one wounded patrolman to speak for me, there are easier ways to arrange it. If I wanted war, I would not be carrying vellum.”",
                           "Edric stared at the ring.",
                           "Pip stopped chewing.",
                           "Thunder moved somewhere far off, though the sky had shown no lightning.",
