                           "“Because secrecy is failing. Your patrols come farther into the mountains. Our traders need markets. Someone is attacking your caravans and dressing the answer in goblin colors.” Gobolin returned the ring to his neck. “If we do not speak now, others will speak for us.”",
                           "For a long time the rain made the only argument.",
                           "Then came a whistle from the road: two high notes and one low.",
